<style>
.recovery{color:#183d33;margin:0 0 30px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #b9cdc3;border-radius:16px;background:#fffdf8}.recovery *{box-sizing:border-box}.recovery .eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#34705d;margin:0 0 8px}.recovery h2{font-size:clamp(25px,3.8vw,39px);line-height:1.13;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0 0 13px}.recovery h3{font-size:21px;margin:26px 0 9px}.recovery p{line-height:1.55}.recovery .sub{font-size:13px;color:#566e61;max-width:1000px}.recovery .status{display:inline-block;background:#f7e5c6;color:#6b4919;padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid #ddc094;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px}.recovery .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:20px 0}.recovery .card{background:#f1f6f0;border:1px solid #d2ded5;padding:15px;border-radius:10px}.recovery .card strong{display:block;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.035em}.recovery .card span{font-size:12px;display:block;line-height:1.45}.recovery .note{background:#f7eedc;border-left:4px solid #bc9146;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:5px}.recovery details{margin:13px 0}.recovery summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:650}.recovery .facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.recovery .facts div{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d4ded6;font-size:13px}.recovery .facts b{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#496958;margin-bottom:4px}.recovery .controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:end;margin:18px 0}.recovery label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:12px}.recovery input,.recovery select,.recovery button{font:inherit;border:1px solid #b4c7b9;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;padding:9px;color:inherit;min-height:38px}.recovery button{cursor:pointer}.recovery button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.45}.recovery .tablewrap{overflow:auto;max-width:100%;border:1px solid #d3dfd5;border-radius:8px}.recovery table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px;text-align:left}.recovery th{background:#edf3ed;padding:12px 10px;white-space:nowrap}.recovery td{padding:12px 10px;border-top:1px solid #e0e6df;vertical-align:top}.recovery .muted{font-size:11px;color:#647368}.recovery .pager{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:10px 0}.recovery a{color:#176a54;text-decoration:underline}.recovery .foot{font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid #d0ddd2;padding-top:13px;margin-top:24px}.recovery .metric-note{font-size:12px;color:#6b4919}.recovery .outcome-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}.recovery .outcome-grid p{font-size:12px;background:#f4f6ef;padding:10px;border-radius:7px;margin:0}.recovery code{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.recovery section{margin:23px 0}.recovery .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}@media(max-width:700px){.recovery{padding:17px 12px}.recovery .cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.recovery .facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.recovery .outcome-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.recovery .controls label{flex:1;min-width:120px}.recovery input{width:100%}.recovery th,.recovery td{padding:10px 8px}.recovery .pager{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
<section class="recovery" id="b063r1-recovery" aria-labelledby="r1-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">November 12 recovery update · NCAA men and women</p>
  <span class="status">B063 stopped during startup validation</span>
  <h2 id="r1-heading">Preserved forecasts. A verified failure. A tested repair.</h2>
  <p class="sub" id="r1-evidence-time"></p>
  <p>The B063 owner return confirms a startup-test failure before model research began. The repair addresses how spawned-worker memory was measured. Its next owner execution and 12-core research benchmark remain pending.</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card"><strong>0</strong><span>New B063 sports-model fits<br>and new forecast issues</span></div>
    <div class="card"><strong>90</strong><span>Additional selected original issues<br>recovered across 30 games</span></div>
    <div class="card"><strong>232</strong><span>Selected original rows available<br>including the preserved 142 below</span></div>
    <div class="card"><strong>12 / 1</strong><span>CPUs configured / startup CPUs leased<br>Parallel owner benchmark not reached</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note"><b>Fresh current and upcoming forecasts remain pending B063R1 owner execution and qualification.</b> These recovered issues retain their November 11–12 clocks. The selected early games are now past; their outcomes were not refreshed. The 3,425-game inventory below is a dated November 11 snapshot, not the complete official current-season universe. Existing champion tables, frozen-season evaluations and earlier status records remain unchanged in the preserved B062 report.</p>
  <details id="r1-run-details"><summary>Inspect the failed run and the memory repair</summary>
    <div class="facts" id="r1-run-facts"></div>
    <p class="sub">The failing probe compared inherited process high-water history with its worker allowance. The repair reads the worker’s current address-space high-water measurement and keeps the 1 GiB guard. Missing or invalid memory evidence still fails validation. This engineering check does not establish scientific throughput or the RAM needed by twelve fitted-model workers.</p>
  </details>
  <section id="r1-selected-issues" aria-labelledby="r1-issues-heading">
    <h3 id="r1-issues-heading">Recovered selected-role original forecasts</h3>
    <p class="sub">Latest original issue for each game and target under the preserved historical role policy. No current outcome was used to choose rows. Values are rounded for display; original records, clocks and full precision remain in the authenticated archive. These are research issues, not newly qualified current champions.</p>
    <div class="controls">
      <label>League<select id="r1-league"><option value="all">Men and women</option><option value="ncaam">Men</option><option value="ncaaw">Women</option></select></label>
      <label>Target<select id="r1-target"><option value="all">All targets</option><option value="win">Home win probability</option><option value="margin">Home margin</option><option value="total">Total points</option></select></label>
      <label>Find a game<input id="r1-search" type="search" placeholder="Team or event" autocomplete="off"></label>
      <button id="r1-download" type="button">Download selected rows</button>
    </div>
    <p class="sub" id="r1-issue-count" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div class="tablewrap"><table id="r1-issues-table"><thead><tr><th>League / game</th><th>Original scheduled tip (UTC)</th><th>Target / prediction</th><th>Issued at (UTC)</th><th>Preserved role / evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
    <div class="pager"><button id="r1-prev" type="button">Previous</button><span id="r1-page" class="sub"></span><button id="r1-next" type="button">Next</button></div>
  </section>
  <section id="r1-postissue-monitor" aria-labelledby="r1-monitor-heading">
    <h3 id="r1-monitor-heading">Eight-game post-issue monitoring</h3>
    <p class="sub">Official school finals are later observations, kept separate from the original pregame issues. This small selected cohort does not establish a current-season champion, market advantage or independent prospective confirmation.</p>
    <div id="r1-outcome-cards" class="outcome-grid"></div>
    <p id="r1-monitor-status" class="metric-note"></p>
    <div class="tablewrap"><table id="r1-monitor-table"><thead><tr><th>League / model role</th><th>Target</th><th>Games</th><th>Accuracy</th><th>Log loss</th><th>Brier</th><th>MAE</th><th>RMSE</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
  </section>
  <p class="foot" id="r1-source-note"></p>
</section>
<script id="b063r1-data" type="application/json">__RECOVERY_DATA__</script>
<script>
(() => {
  'use strict';
  const data = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('b063r1-data').textContent);
  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);
  const esc = value => String(value ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, c => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
  const utc = value => value ? value.replace('T', ' ').replace(/(?:\.\d+)?\+00:00$/, '').replace('Z', '') : 'Unavailable';
  const league = value => value === 'ncaam' ? 'Men' : 'Women';
  const labels = {win:'Home win', margin:'Home margin', total:'Total points'};
  const num = (value, digits=6) => value == null ? '—' : Number(value).toFixed(digits);
  const owner = data.actual_owner;
  $('r1-evidence-time').textContent='Report snapshot: '+utc(data.asof_utc)+' UTC. Actual owner return: '+utc(owner.completed_at)+' UTC. Eight later official finals observed: '+utc(data.late_monitor.outcome_observed_at_utc)+' UTC.';
  const facts = [
    ['Owner run', owner.run_id], ['Started / completed (UTC)', utc(owner.started_at)+' / '+utc(owner.completed_at)],
    ['Startup tests', owner.tests_passed+' passed · '+owner.tests_failed+' failed · '+owner.tests_skipped+' skipped'],
    ['Failure', 'PROBE_EXCEEDED_RESERVED_WORKER_MEMORY'],
    ['Actual tracked scientific workers / observed CPU', '0 / '+owner.peak_observed_cpu_cores.toFixed(3)+' cores'],
    ['Owner peak RSS / sampled process-tree PSS', (owner.peak_rss_bytes/1073741824).toFixed(3)+' / '+(owner.peak_process_tree_pss_bytes/1073741824).toFixed(3)+' GiB'],
    ['Estimated whole-instance cost', '$'+owner.estimated_whole_instance_cost_usd.toFixed(3)+' at $'+owner.verified_instance_rate_usd_per_hour.toFixed(2)+'/hour; not project-attributed billing'],
    ['Recovery receipt', 'Inner return verified; outer launcher receipt not reauthenticated'],
    ['B063R1 repair', data.repair.status_display],
    ['Scientific credit', '0 new fits · 0 runtime-validated reused fits · 0 new issues · 0 promotions']
  ];
  $('r1-run-facts').innerHTML = facts.map(([label,value])=>'<div><b>'+esc(label)+'</b>'+esc(value)+'</div>').join('');
  let page = 0; const pageSize = 15;
  function filtered() { const q=$('r1-search').value.toLowerCase();return data.selected_originals.filter(r=>($('r1-league').value==='all'||r.league===$('r1-league').value)&&($('r1-target').value==='all'||r.target===$('r1-target').value)&&(!q||(r.home_team+' '+r.away_team+' '+r.event_id).toLowerCase().includes(q))); }
  function renderIssues() {
    const rows=filtered(), totalPages=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(rows.length/pageSize)); page=Math.min(page,totalPages-1);
    $('r1-issue-count').textContent=rows.length+' selected original rows across '+new Set(rows.map(r=>r.event_id)).size+' games. Archived scheduled times; no new upcoming forecast credit.';
    $('r1-issues-table').querySelector('tbody').innerHTML=rows.slice(page*pageSize,(page+1)*pageSize).map(r=>'<tr><td><b>'+league(r.league)+'</b><br>'+esc(r.away_team)+' at '+esc(r.home_team)+'<br><span class="muted">'+esc(r.event_id)+'</span></td><td>'+esc(utc(r.event_time))+'<br><span class="muted">Outcome not refreshed</span></td><td>'+labels[r.target]+'<br><b>'+(r.target==='win'?num(r.prediction*100,3)+'%':num(r.prediction,3))+'</b></td><td>'+esc(utc(r.issued_at))+'</td><td>'+esc(r.model_role_alias.replaceAll('_',' '))+'<details><summary>Original clock proof</summary><span class="muted">Server: '+esc(utc(r.server_last_modified_utc))+'<br>Cutoff: '+esc(utc(r.cutoff_time))+'<br>Issue hash: <code>'+esc(r.issue_record_sha256)+'</code><br>Preserved role; no new promotion.</span></details></td></tr>').join('') || '<tr><td colspan="5">No selected original rows match these filters.</td></tr>';
    $('r1-page').textContent='Page '+(page+1)+' of '+totalPages;$('r1-prev').disabled=page===0;$('r1-next').disabled=page>=totalPages-1;
  }
  ['r1-league','r1-target','r1-search'].forEach(id=>$(id).addEventListener(id==='r1-search'?'input':'change',()=>{page=0;renderIssues();}));
  $('r1-prev').addEventListener('click',()=>{page--;renderIssues();});$('r1-next').addEventListener('click',()=>{page++;renderIssues();});
  $('r1-download').addEventListener('click',()=>{
    const keys=['league','event_id','home_team','away_team','event_time','target','prediction','issued_at','server_last_modified_utc','cutoff_time','model_role_alias','issue_record_sha256'];
    const cell=v=>'"'+String(v??'').replaceAll('"','""')+'"';
    const content=[keys.join(','),...filtered().map(r=>keys.map(k=>cell(r[k])).join(','))].join('\n');
    const link=document.createElement('a'),url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([content],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}));link.href=url;link.download='ncaa_b062_selected_original_recovery.csv';link.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);
  });
  const monitor=data.late_monitor;
  $('r1-outcome-cards').innerHTML=(monitor.outcomes||[]).map(r=>'<p><b>'+league(r.league)+' · '+esc(r.home_team)+'</b><br>'+r.actual_home_points+'–'+r.actual_away_points+' vs '+esc(r.away_team)+'<br><a href="'+esc(r.source_url)+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official final ↗</a></p>').join('');
  $('r1-monitor-status').textContent=monitor.status_display;
  $('r1-monitor-table').querySelector('tbody').innerHTML=(monitor.metrics||[]).map(r=>'<tr><td>'+league(r.league)+'<br>'+esc(r.public_model_id)+'</td><td>'+labels[r.target]+'</td><td>'+r.n+'</td><td>'+num(r.accuracy,4)+'</td><td>'+num(r.log_loss)+'</td><td>'+num(r.brier)+'</td><td>'+num(r.mae)+'</td><td>'+num(r.rmse)+'</td></tr>').join('') || '<tr><td colspan="9">Full-precision original-record reconciliation pending; rounded public predictions do not supply metric authority.</td></tr>';
  $('r1-source-note').textContent='Snapshot '+utc(data.asof_utc)+' UTC. Separate recovery and monitoring observations; no provider refresh or owner science is implied. The unchanged B062 report follows, retaining its frozen seasons, champion-role tables, provider coverage and earlier original issues.';
  renderIssues();
})();
</script>
